        <mxCell id="-YYNMSj9uA3AfLoBCzaS-1" value="&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1472&quot; data-start=&quot;1421&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;1472&quot; data-start=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Separate Pods for AI Agent and VM&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1472&quot; data-start=&quot;1421&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;✅ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;1489&quot; data-start=&quot;1480&quot;&gt;Pros:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;1526&quot; data-start=&quot;1493&quot;&gt;Modularity &amp;amp; Maintainability:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; AI agent and VM can be updated, restarted, or replaced independently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;1616&quot; data-start=&quot;1600&quot;&gt;Scalability:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; If your AI agent eventually controls multiple VMs, you can scale them independently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;1732&quot; data-start=&quot;1705&quot;&gt;Better Fault Isolation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; If the AI agent fails, the VM remains unaffected (and vice versa).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;1829&quot; data-start=&quot;1803&quot;&gt;Resource Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; K8s can allocate resources more effectively based on individual pod needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;1939&quot; data-start=&quot;1908&quot;&gt;Easier Multi-Agent Scaling:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; You could deploy multiple AI agents that control different VMs dynamically.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2050&quot; data-start=&quot;2019&quot;&gt;More Cloud-Native Approach:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; In a microservices world, breaking things into modular components that interact over APIs is a best practice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;❌ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2178&quot; data-start=&quot;2169&quot;&gt;Cons:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2204&quot; data-start=&quot;2182&quot;&gt;Higher Complexity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; Requires additional inter-pod communication and service discovery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2306&quot; data-start=&quot;2275&quot;&gt;Potential Latency Overhead:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; Network-based communication might be slower than local communication inside a pod.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;2424&quot; data-start=&quot;2393&quot;&gt;More Configurations Needed:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; AI agent must be explicitly told which VM it controls, which means additional service discovery logic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2895" y="-97.5" width="1359" height="600" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-YYNMSj9uA3AfLoBCzaS-2" value="&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;359&quot; data-start=&quot;293&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot; data-end=&quot;359&quot; data-start=&quot;297&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Single Pod Deployment (AI Agent + VM in One Pod)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;✅ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;376&quot; data-start=&quot;367&quot;&gt;Pros:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1472&quot; data-start=&quot;1421&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;404&quot; data-start=&quot;380&quot;&gt;Tighter Integration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; Since the AI agent and VM are in the same pod, they can communicate more efficiently with low-latency IPC or direct memory sharing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;563&quot; data-start=&quot;540&quot;&gt;Simpler Networking:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; No need for inter-pod communication—everything is local.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;671&quot; data-start=&quot;624&quot;&gt;Easier Deployment &amp;amp; Scaling (for one unit):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; The whole system (AI + VM) scales together as one unit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;752&quot; data-start=&quot;731&quot;&gt;Shared Resources:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; They can share persistent volumes or configurations directly without needing a service discovery mechanism.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;❌ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;878&quot; data-start=&quot;869&quot;&gt;Cons:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1472&quot; data-start=&quot;1421&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot; data-start=&quot;882&quot;&gt;Reduced Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; If you need to modify, scale, or restart only one component (AI or VM), you must restart or redeploy the entire pod.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;1063&quot; data-start=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;Resource Allocation Constraints:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; The VM might have fluctuating resource demands, which could affect the AI agent running in the same pod.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;1204&quot; data-start=&quot;1172&quot;&gt;Harder to Enforce Isolation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; If the AI agent crashes or misbehaves, it could take the VM down with it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;1306&quot; data-start=&quot;1282&quot;&gt;Limited Scalability:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; What if the AI agent needs to manage multiple VMs? You’d need multiple pods, each duplicating the AI agent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2880" y="-1220" width="1359" height="600" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
