          <mxGeometry x="1124.11" y="-2150" width="1783.78" height="990" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lmNmcNDEGcmSTbuAn9c4-2" value="" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="-1120" width="1498" height="868.96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lmNmcNDEGcmSTbuAn9c4-4" value="Only&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&quot;Interactive&quot; learning&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;via&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Trial and Error&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;No memory&lt;/div&gt;" style="strokeWidth=1;shadow=0;dashed=0;align=center;html=1;shape=mxgraph.mockup.text.stickyNote2;fontColor=#666666;mainText=;fontSize=17;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffcc;strokeColor=#F62E00;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2110" y="-216" width="210" height="256" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lmNmcNDEGcmSTbuAn9c4-5" value="" style="shape=flexArrow;endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2350" y="-90" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2960" y="-90" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lmNmcNDEGcmSTbuAn9c4-6" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Add learning&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;3983&quot; data-start=&quot;3899&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;3935&quot; data-start=&quot;3901&quot;&gt;Simple history-based learning?&lt;/strong&gt; → Store past actions and results in a database.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;4045&quot; data-start=&quot;3984&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;4011&quot; data-start=&quot;3986&quot;&gt;Optimizing over time?&lt;/strong&gt; → Use &lt;strong data-end=&quot;4044&quot; data-start=&quot;4018&quot;&gt;Reinforcement Learning&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;4107&quot; data-start=&quot;4046&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;4082&quot; data-start=&quot;4048&quot;&gt;Adapting quickly to new tasks?&lt;/strong&gt; → Use &lt;strong data-end=&quot;4106&quot; data-start=&quot;4089&quot;&gt;Meta-Learning&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;4162&quot; data-start=&quot;4108&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;4134&quot; data-start=&quot;4110&quot;&gt;Enhancing reasoning?&lt;/strong&gt; → Use a &lt;strong data-end=&quot;4161&quot; data-start=&quot;4143&quot;&gt;Knowledge Base&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3090" y="-251.04" width="490" height="141.04" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lmNmcNDEGcmSTbuAn9c4-7" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Types of Learnings&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;569&quot; data-start=&quot;518&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;569&quot; data-start=&quot;522&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;1)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;569&quot; data-start=&quot;522&quot;&gt;Episodic Memory (Storing Past Attempts)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1306&quot; data-start=&quot;570&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;804&quot; data-start=&quot;570&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;590&quot; data-start=&quot;572&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;590&quot; data-start=&quot;572&quot;&gt;What to Store?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;804&quot; data-start=&quot;593&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;618&quot; data-start=&quot;593&quot;&gt;Task ID and description&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;666&quot; data-start=&quot;621&quot;&gt;Actions taken (keyboard/mouse interactions)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;714&quot; data-start=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Screenshots or accessibility tree snapshots&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;754&quot; data-start=&quot;717&quot;&gt;Final task status (Success/Failure)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;801&quot; data-start=&quot;757&quot;&gt;Errors encountered and corrected solutions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1110&quot; data-start=&quot;805&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;831&quot; data-start=&quot;807&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;831&quot; data-start=&quot;807&quot;&gt;Implementation Idea:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1110&quot; data-start=&quot;834&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;976&quot; data-start=&quot;834&quot;&gt;Each time an agent attempts a task, it logs this information into a database (e.g., SQLite, JSON files, or a vector database for retrieval).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1110&quot; data-start=&quot;979&quot;&gt;The next time the same task is encountered, the agent can check &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1075&quot; data-start=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;past successful strategies&lt;/strong&gt; and avoid repeating past mistakes.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1306&quot; data-start=&quot;1112&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1135&quot; data-start=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1135&quot; data-start=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;Example Use Case:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1306&quot; data-start=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1306&quot; data-start=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;If the agent fails to rename a file because the UI changed, it stores this failure and learns an alternative method (e.g., using a CLI command instead of GUI clicks).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr data-end=&quot;1311&quot; data-start=&quot;1308&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1378&quot; data-start=&quot;1313&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1378&quot; data-start=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;2) Reinforcement Learning (Optimizing Actions Over Time)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1985&quot; data-start=&quot;1379&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1503&quot; data-start=&quot;1379&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1399&quot; data-start=&quot;1381&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1399&quot; data-start=&quot;1381&quot;&gt;What to Store?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1503&quot; data-start=&quot;1402&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1442&quot; data-start=&quot;1402&quot;&gt;State-action-reward pairs (like in RL)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1473&quot; data-start=&quot;1445&quot;&gt;Q-values or policy updates&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1503&quot; data-start=&quot;1476&quot;&gt;Success rate per strategy&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1817&quot; data-start=&quot;1505&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1531&quot; data-start=&quot;1507&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1531&quot; data-start=&quot;1507&quot;&gt;Implementation Idea:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1817&quot; data-start=&quot;1534&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1605&quot; data-start=&quot;1534&quot;&gt;The agent assigns &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1565&quot; data-start=&quot;1554&quot;&gt;rewards&lt;/strong&gt; to actions based on success or failure.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1685&quot; data-start=&quot;1608&quot;&gt;Over time, it learns which &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1661&quot; data-start=&quot;1637&quot;&gt;sequences of actions&lt;/strong&gt; are the most efficient.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1817&quot; data-start=&quot;1688&quot;&gt;This could be implemented using &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1736&quot; data-start=&quot;1722&quot;&gt;Q-learning&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1788&quot; data-start=&quot;1740&quot;&gt;Deep Reinforcement Learning (DQN, PPO, etc.)&lt;/strong&gt; to optimize decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1985&quot; data-start=&quot;1819&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1842&quot; data-start=&quot;1821&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1842&quot; data-start=&quot;1821&quot;&gt;Example Use Case:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1985&quot; data-start=&quot;1845&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1985&quot; data-start=&quot;1845&quot;&gt;If renaming a file via the GUI has a 40% success rate but using a command line has a 90% success rate, the agent &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1984&quot; data-start=&quot;1960&quot;&gt;learns to prefer CLI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr data-end=&quot;1990&quot; data-start=&quot;1987&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;2039&quot; data-start=&quot;1992&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2039&quot; data-start=&quot;1996&quot;&gt;3) Meta-Learning (Few-Shot Adaptation)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;2716&quot; data-start=&quot;2040&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2226&quot; data-start=&quot;2040&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2060&quot; data-start=&quot;2042&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2060&quot; data-start=&quot;2042&quot;&gt;What to Store?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;2226&quot; data-start=&quot;2063&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2149&quot; data-start=&quot;2063&quot;&gt;Task category similarities (e.g., &quot;rename file&quot; in LibreOffice vs. Windows Explorer)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2196&quot; data-start=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;High-level strategies for similar problems&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2226&quot; data-start=&quot;2199&quot;&gt;Model fine-tuning updates&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2549&quot; data-start=&quot;2228&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2254&quot; data-start=&quot;2230&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2254&quot; data-start=&quot;2230&quot;&gt;Implementation Idea:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;2549&quot; data-start=&quot;2257&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2402&quot; data-start=&quot;2257&quot;&gt;Use &lt;strong data-end=&quot;2303&quot; data-start=&quot;2263&quot;&gt;retrieval-augmented generation (RAG)&lt;/strong&gt;: Before executing a task, the agent checks &lt;strong data-end=&quot;2369&quot; data-start=&quot;2347&quot;&gt;similar past tasks&lt;/strong&gt; and retrieves the best solution.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2549&quot; data-start=&quot;2405&quot;&gt;Train a model using &lt;strong data-end=&quot;2455&quot; data-start=&quot;2427&quot;&gt;meta-learning algorithms&lt;/strong&gt; like MAML (Model-Agnostic Meta-Learning) so it can generalize to new tasks with fewer trials.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2716&quot; data-start=&quot;2551&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2574&quot; data-start=&quot;2553&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2574&quot; data-start=&quot;2553&quot;&gt;Example Use Case:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;2716&quot; data-start=&quot;2577&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2716&quot; data-start=&quot;2577&quot;&gt;If the agent successfully applies &lt;strong data-end=&quot;2640&quot; data-start=&quot;2613&quot;&gt;text formatting in Word&lt;/strong&gt;, it can generalize this knowledge when asked to format text in Google Docs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr data-end=&quot;2721&quot; data-start=&quot;2718&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;2780&quot; data-start=&quot;2723&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2780&quot; data-start=&quot;2727&quot;&gt;4) External Knowledge Base (Memory Augmentation)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;3314&quot; data-start=&quot;2781&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2937&quot; data-start=&quot;2781&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2801&quot; data-start=&quot;2783&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2801&quot; data-start=&quot;2783&quot;&gt;What to Store?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;2937&quot; data-start=&quot;2804&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2839&quot; data-start=&quot;2804&quot;&gt;Common OS commands for automation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2879&quot; data-start=&quot;2842&quot;&gt;API interactions for frequent tasks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;2937&quot; data-start=&quot;2882&quot;&gt;User preferences (e.g., &quot;Always prefer CLI over GUI&quot;)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;3140&quot; data-start=&quot;2939&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;2965&quot; data-start=&quot;2941&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;2965&quot; data-start=&quot;2941&quot;&gt;Implementation Idea:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;3140&quot; data-start=&quot;2968&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;3037&quot; data-start=&quot;2968&quot;&gt;Store structured knowledge (JSON, vector embeddings) for reference.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;3140&quot; data-start=&quot;3040&quot;&gt;When the agent is unsure about an action, it first queries the &lt;strong data-end=&quot;3123&quot; data-start=&quot;3105&quot;&gt;knowledge base&lt;/strong&gt; before guessing.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;3314&quot; data-start=&quot;3142&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;3165&quot; data-start=&quot;3144&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;3165&quot; data-start=&quot;3144&quot;&gt;Example Use Case:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;3314&quot; data-start=&quot;3168&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;3314&quot; data-start=&quot;3168&quot;&gt;If the agent fails to open a terminal in macOS, it looks up a stored reference and tries &lt;code data-end=&quot;3285&quot; data-start=&quot;3259&quot;&gt;Cmd + Space → &quot;Terminal&quot;&lt;/code&gt; instead of guessing blindly.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3080" y="-70" width="860" height="1240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
